OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie prisoners face weekend
OL,4,Awithout running water in cells
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water supply issue affecting a number
OL,7,Fof prisoners in Scotland's largest jail
OL,8,Fis likely to continue throughout the
OL,9,Fweekend.
OL,11,FSome inmates at two halls in Barlinnie
OL,12,Fin Glasgow had no running water in
OL,13,Ftheir cells overnight and no access to
OL,14,Fbottled water.
OL,16,FBut the Scottish Prison Service (SPS)
OL,17,Fsaid the issue was proving more
OL,18,Fdifficult to fully resolve and staff
OL,19,Fwould continue to support people
OL,20,Faffected with the available water
OL,21,Fsupply and bottled water.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
