OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie prisoners face weekend
OL,4,Awithout running water in cells
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne woman told BBC Scotland News that
OL,7,Fthe situation, which left some inmates
OL,8,Funable to flush the toilet, was
OL,9,F"completely unacceptable."
